    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in a dimly lit, subterranean facility with no memory of how you arrived. The air is stale, and the faint hum of ancient electronics echoes through the cold stone corridors. This place appears to be an abandoned cryptographic research bunker, filled with strange devices, locked containers, and forgotten secrets. A heavily armored door stands between you and freedom, its electronic lock demanding a highly specific cryptographic sequence. To escape, you must explore the bunker, interact with the peculiar machinery left behind, and carefully trace the flow of data through a series of complex tools. Every device is connected in a logical chain, and finding the right inputs for each terminal is your only way out. Time is ticking, and the shadows seem to grow longer by the minute.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
  },
